## Default work (when goal is vague)

Next **unchecked** box on `docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md` **Program 3**, in order:
Play-install first hour → day-2–7 cave + Welcome Back → week-1 crawl mix →
cadence tag → owner D1 paste / listing experiment.
